Nope, you don’t have to worry about that. Once your beat is sold with an **Exclusive License** on Beat22, it is **automatically taken down from the platform**. The system handles it instantly; no manual action needed from your side.

1.  It’s fully automated
2.  No risk of double selling
3.  You stay focused on creating

Beat22 takes care of the backend, so you don’t have to.
